+              </li>
+              <li>
+                <b>Set a timeout</b> (10 seconds is plenty) so a slow network doesn&apos;t hang your app.
+              </li>
+              <li>
+                <b>Handle empty values.</b> <C>description</C>, <C>area</C>, <C>type</C> and <C>rating</C> can be empty or
